# VITE_API_URL is intentionally unset everywhere now. The app falls back to
# "/api", which is proxied to the backend in both environments:
#   - local dev: the Vite proxy forwards /api/* to http://localhost:3000
#   - production: a Vercel rewrite (see vercel.json) forwards /api/* to Render
# Same-origin requests keep the auth cookie first-party — pointing this straight
# at the Render origin makes the cookie third-party, which mobile Safari/WebKit
# silently drops (login loops forever on phones). Only set this if you know you
# need to bypass the proxy.
VITE_API_URL=
